{
  "key": "letter-291-part-01",
  "number": 291,
  "generationId": "01a1e903-b68c-734b-80fd-16dcdc5a4d23",
  "voice": "Views",
  "speed": 0.9,
  "clips": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "Love.",
      "path": "audio/1971-291/01.mp3",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 0.707029
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "You cannot run away from the self because you are the self - how can you run away from it?",
      "path": "audio/1971-291/02.mp3",
      "start": 1.9393880000000001,
      "end": 6.365646
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "It is like running from one's own shadow: all your efforts are bound to be futile.",
      "path": "audio/1971-291/03.mp3",
      "start": 7.569456,
      "end": 11.943401
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "Rather, stop and see it, witness it, be aware of it.",
      "path": "audio/1971-291/04.mp3",
      "start": 13.119252000000001,
      "end": 16.836417
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "Face the shadow and then - where is it?",
      "path": "audio/1971-291/05.mp3",
      "start": 18.068027,
      "end": 20.798277000000002
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "It has never been, really.",
      "path": "audio/1971-291/06.mp3",
      "start": 22.387459999999997,
      "end": 23.897302
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "You created it by not facing it and you strengthened it by running from it.",
      "path": "audio/1971-291/07.mp3",
      "start": 25.487664,
      "end": 31.799297
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "Is it not time now to stop the game?",
      "path": "audio/1971-291/08.mp3",
      "start": 33.32771,
      "end": 35.76
    }
  ]
}
